    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WingWhiz</strong> is a fast-paced arcade shooter packed with rogue-lite progression and bullet-hell action. Unlock new planes as you progress\u2014each with unique stats, weapons, and abilities. Dodge enemy fire and unleash bullets, rockets, and special attacks to tear enemies apart. All enemy NPCs can be physically destroyed, making every battle feel explosive and dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different, with randomized encounters, enemy patterns, and challenges. Fly through shifting worlds, face changing enemy types, and battle powerful bosses at the end of every act. The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, collect coins and unlock permanent upgrades in the Hangar to prepare for your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky keeps changing\u2014so must you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/68df8c91d788f3cd4e48b552c5fc26e1.poster.avif?t=1752061431\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/68df8c91d788f3cd4e48b552c5fc26e1.webm?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/68df8c91d788f3cd4e48b552c5fc26e1.mp4?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of planes, each with unique stats and special abilities like dash or missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, bullet-hell combat where every enemy and object can be physically destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience rogue-lite progression with randomized encounters, hazards, and enemy patterns in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend collected coins on permanent upgrades in the Hangar\u2014boost fire rate, health, fuel capacity, and unlock global power-up perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight intense bosses at the end of each world to unlock new environments and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple themed worlds like Desert, Underground, Ocean, Forest, and Space\u2014each with unique visuals, enemy types and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shoot combos and near-miss streaks mid-run to increase your fire-power, score and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for high replayability, with runs that evolve as your skills and upgrades grow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c2075a4f5223c95e4c6f9bcc32e34d6d.poster.avif?t=1752061431\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c2075a4f5223c95e4c6f9bcc32e34d6d.webm?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c2075a4f5223c95e4c6f9bcc32e34d6d.mp4?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WingWhiz</strong> is a fast-paced arcade shooter packed with rogue-lite progression and bullet-hell action. Unlock new planes as you progress\u2014each with unique stats, weapons, and abilities. Dodge enemy fire and unleash bullets, rockets, and special attacks to tear enemies apart. All enemy NPCs can be physically destroyed, making every battle feel explosive and dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different, with randomized encounters, enemy patterns, and challenges. Fly through shifting worlds, face changing enemy types, and battle powerful bosses at the end of every act. The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, collect coins and unlock permanent upgrades in the Hangar to prepare for your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky keeps changing\u2014so must you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/68df8c91d788f3cd4e48b552c5fc26e1.poster.avif?t=1752061431\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/68df8c91d788f3cd4e48b552c5fc26e1.webm?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/68df8c91d788f3cd4e48b552c5fc26e1.mp4?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of planes, each with unique stats and special abilities like dash or missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, bullet-hell combat where every enemy and object can be physically destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience rogue-lite progression with randomized encounters, hazards, and enemy patterns in every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend collected coins on permanent upgrades in the Hangar\u2014boost fire rate, health, fuel capacity, and unlock global power-up perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight intense bosses at the end of each world to unlock new environments and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple themed worlds like Desert, Underground, Ocean, Forest, and Space\u2014each with unique visuals, enemy types and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shoot combos and near-miss streaks mid-run to increase your fire-power, score and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for high replayability, with runs that evolve as your skills and upgrades grow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c2075a4f5223c95e4c6f9bcc32e34d6d.poster.avif?t=1752061431\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c2075a4f5223c95e4c6f9bcc32e34d6d.webm?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816220/extras/c2075a4f5223c95e4c6f9bcc32e34d6d.mp4?t=1752061431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "WingWhiz is a fast-paced arcade shooter with rogue-lite elements. Unlock unique planes, dodge bullets, fire rockets, and blast enemies into pieces. Survive random encounters, defeat brutal bosses, and push further every run. Adapt or explode\u2014the sky won\u2019t stay the same.",
